Colombia,COL,12. Can a cyber operation alone constitute an armed attack for purposes of triggering the right of self-defense?,Yes,“A cyber activity or operation that amounts to an armed attack may invoke... self-defense.”,"Colombia’s National Position on International Law in Cyberspace, pg. 15, § 12.1 (2025)",https://perma.cc/9R5K-K447,
