Italy,ITA,6)Is the exercise of the right of self-defense subject to the principle of proportionality?,Yes,"The occurrence of an armed attack triggers the right to self-defence, and the victim-State may resort to all necessary and proportionate means to end the aggression.",Italian Position Paper on International Law and Cyberspace,https://tuprd.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/iLITHome/iLIT%20Student%20Researchers/Global%20Cyber%20Law/National%20Cyber%20Statements/Source%20Materials/National%20Statements/Italy/Italy_International%20Law%20and%20Cyberspace.pdf?csf=1&web=1&e=uLarpe,
