Sweden,SWE,6)Is the exercise of the right of self-defense subject to the principle of proportionality?,Yes,"Any use of force in the exercise of self-defence, including through cyber means, needs to adhere to principles of necessity and proportionality.",Sweden’s Position Paper on the Application of International Law in Cyberspace,https://tuprd.sharepoint.com/:b:/r/sites/iLITHome/iLIT%20Student%20Researchers/Global%20Cyber%20Law/National%20Cyber%20Statements/Source%20Materials/National%20Statements/Sweden/swedens-position-paper-on-the-application-of-international-law-in-cyberspace.pdf?csf=1&web=1&e=2GIU3a,
